{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7c4e19b-2d58-4f01-9b6e-8c0f3d5a1e44",
    "name": "Content Chain — DEMO guest",
    "description": "Żywy HTTP DEMO MODE + rola guest (`SPEC-TESTY.md` D-50…D-62). **Nie** zastępuje Jest.\n\nWymaga `DEMO_MODE=true` oraz Redis (`REDIS_URL` albo `REDIS_HOST`+`REDIS_PORT`) w `apps/api/.env` — walidacja env fail-fast przy starcie. Collection Runner **nie** jest T-5 CI.\n\nKolejność folderów: **Config → Register guest → Allow → Deny → Admin przy demo**.\n\n`POST /runs` w Allow wymaga **kompletnego** company-context w DB (np. Setup z `social-pipeline.postman-collection.json` jako admin, zanim odpalisz tę kolekcję). Gateway jest potrzebny tylko przy starcie runu (jak inne pipeline’y).\n\nCookie jar włączony. Register **nie** stawia cookies — login guest w folderze Register. Zmienne `guestEmail` / `guestPassword`: prerequest nadpisuje email unikalnym znacznikiem czasu, żeby nie łapać 409.\n\nGdy `GET /config` wróci `demoMode: false`, reszta runnera nie ma sensu — patrz README.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/v1" },
    { "key": "guestEmail", "value": "guest@example.com" },
    { "key": "guestPassword", "value": "Password12!!" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@example.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Password12!!" },
    { "key": "dummyRunId", "value": "run_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET config (demoMode true)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200 without session', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('only demoMode boolean true (D-60)', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(Object.keys(body)).to.eql(['demoMode']);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.demoMode).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('no guest/redis/gateway secrets', function () {",
                  "  const json = JSON.stringify(body);",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.not.match(/GUEST_/);",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.not.match(/REDIS_/);",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.not.include('GATEWAY_KEY');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/config",
            "description": "D-60: publiczny V1 `{ demoMode }`. Gdy false — stop; włącz DEMO_MODE i Redis, zrestartuj api."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Register guest",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST register (role guest)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('guestEmail', 'guest-' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('role guest, no Set-Cookie (D-50)', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.user.role).to.eql('guest');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.user.email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('guestEmail'));",
                  "  pm.expect(body.user.role).to.not.eql('admin');",
                  "  const cookies = pm.response.headers.all()",
                  "    .filter(function (h) { return h.key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie'; })",
                  "    .map(function (h) { return h.value; })",
                  "    .join('\\n');",
                  "  pm.expect(cookies).to.not.include('cc_access=');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{guestEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{guestPassword}}\"\n}\n"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST login guest",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200 guest session', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.user.role).to.eql('guest');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('sets cookies', function () {",
                  "  const cookies = pm.response.headers.all()",
                  "    .filter(function (h) { return h.key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie'; })",
                  "    .map(function (h) { return h.value; })",
                  "    .join('\\n');",
                  "  pm.expect(cookies).to.include('cc_access=');",
                  "  pm.expect(cookies).to.include('cc_refresh=');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{guestEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{guestPassword}}\"\n}\n"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
